<doc id="184268" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=184268" title="Anthony Fauci">
Anthony Fauci

Anthony Stephen Fauci (; #ALIH) yaiku dokter lan pakar &lt;a href="imunologi"&gt;imunologi&lt;/a&gt; saka Amerika Sarekat sing ngejabat minangka direktur &lt;a href="National%20Institute%20of%20Allergy%20and%20Infectious%20Diseases"&gt;National Institute of Allergy and Infectious Diseases&lt;/a&gt; (NIAID) sawise 1984. Sawise Januari 2010, ia dadi salah sijining anggota utami &lt;a href="White%20House%20Coronavirus%20Task%20Force"&gt;White House Coronavirus Task Force&lt;/a&gt; saka &lt;a href="Kapresidhenan%20Donald%20Trump"&gt;Papréntahan Trump&lt;/a&gt; sing ditugasi kanggo nyikapi &lt;a href="pageblug%20COVID-19"&gt;pageblug COVID-19&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="pageblug%20COVID-19%20ing%20Amerika%20Sarekat"&gt;ing Amerika Sarekat&lt;/a&gt;. Ing puncak pandemi kasebut, Fauci akeh dipandang dadi salah sijining tokoh pulitik paling dipercaya ing nagara kasebut.
Fauci akeh diakui minangka salah sijining pakar penyakit infeksi utami ing donya.
