<doc id="184297" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=184297" title="Mykyrokka">
Mykyrokka

Mykyrokka minangka &lt;a href="Soto"&gt;sup&lt;/a&gt; sing minangka panganan tradisional khas ing sisih wétan &lt;a href="Finlan"&gt;Finlandia&lt;/a&gt; (wilayah Savo). Bahan utama yaiku myky: &lt;a href="pangsit"&gt;pangsit&lt;/a&gt; ukuran lontar sing digawe saka glepung &lt;a href="Sar%C3%A9n"&gt;getih&lt;/a&gt; lan gandum. Dumplings dimasak ing sup. Sup uga ngandhut &lt;a href="Kenthang"&gt;kentang&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Bawang%20bombay"&gt;bawang&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="daging"&gt;daging&lt;/a&gt; lemak, lan &lt;a href="jeroan"&gt;jeroan&lt;/a&gt; kayata ginjel, ati lan utawa jantung. &lt;a href="Uyah"&gt;Uyah&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Mrica"&gt;mrico ireng&lt;/a&gt; minangka bumbu biasa.
Sup iki uga disebut tappaiskeitto (yaiku, "sup &lt;a href="jagal"&gt;jagal&lt;/a&gt; ") nuduhake adat pertanian lawas ing mangsa gugur nalika sawetara kewan disembelih lan daging lan organ digawe &lt;a href="sosis"&gt;sosis&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="ham"&gt;ham&lt;/a&gt;, lan daging liyane, lan sing isih dilebokake ing. sup.
