Chacarero

Chacarero minangka salah sawijining jinis olahan masakan &lt;a href="sandwich"&gt;sandwich&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Cil%C3%A9"&gt;Chili&lt;/a&gt; sing digawe karo &lt;a href="Stik"&gt;steak&lt;/a&gt; gaya churrasco sing diiris tipis, utawa &lt;a href="daging%20babi"&gt;daging babi&lt;/a&gt; gaya lomito ing gulungan bunder karo &lt;a href="tomat"&gt;tomat&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Buncis"&gt;kacang&lt;/a&gt; ijo lan &lt;a href="Lombok%20abang"&gt;mrico&lt;/a&gt; ijo. 
Iki minangka salah sawijining macem-macem jinis roti lapis sing disedhiyakake ing chili fuentes de soda, utawa schoperías, &lt;a href="R%C3%A9storan"&gt;restoran&lt;/a&gt; sing padha karo konsep Inggris babagan &lt;a href="Sendhok%20lenga"&gt;sendok greasy&lt;/a&gt;, sing nyedhiyakake &lt;a href="Panganan%20cepet%20saji"&gt;panganan cepet&lt;/a&gt; lan bir. 
