<doc id="184357" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=184357" title="Kösem Sultan">
Kösem Sultan

Kösem Sultan (]) (jeneng lengkap Devletlu İsmetlu Haseki Mahpeyker Kösem Buyuk Valide Sultan Aliyyetü'ş-Şân Hazretleri; 1590 – 2 September 1651) – uga diarani minangka Mahpeyker Sultan (]) – yaiku salah sijining wadon paling berkuasa ing &lt;a href="sajarah%20Utsmaniyah"&gt;sajarah Utsmaniyah&lt;/a&gt;. Minangka permaisuri kinasih lan garwa sah saka &lt;a href="Sultan%20Utsmaniyah"&gt;Sultan Utsmaniyah&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Ahmed%20I"&gt;Ahmed I&lt;/a&gt; (r. 1603–1617), ia entuk kekuasaan lan mengaruhi pulitik &lt;a href="Kekaisaran%20Utsmaniyah"&gt;Kekaisaran Utsmaniyah&lt;/a&gt; liwat garwane, banjur kuwi liwat putra-putrane &lt;a href="Murad%20IV"&gt;Murad IV&lt;/a&gt; (r. 1623–1640) lan &lt;a href="Ibrahim%20saka%20Kekaisaran%20Utsmaniyah"&gt;Ibrahim&lt;/a&gt; (r. 1640–1648), lan pungkasan liwat putune &lt;a href="Mehmed%20IV"&gt;Mehmed IV&lt;/a&gt; (r. 1648–1687). Ia dadi &lt;a href="Valide%20Sultan"&gt;Valide Sultan&lt;/a&gt; nalika putra-putrane Murad IV lan Ibrahim ngejabat minangka sultan Utsmaniyah. Ia menika figur berpengaruh ing wektu &lt;a href="Kesultanan%20Wadon"&gt;Kesultanan Wadon&lt;/a&gt;. Sawise seda, ia dikenal kanthi jeneng "Valide-i Maktule" (ibu sing dipateni), lan "Valide-i Șehide" (ibu sing dadi martir).
