<doc id="184384" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=184384" title="Felicity Jones">
Felicity Jones

Felicity Rose Hadley Jones (#ALIH) yaiku pemeran saka Inggris. Ia miwiti karier akting profesionale sawise cilik. Ing usia 12 taun, ia tampil ing &lt;a href="The%20Treasure%20Seekers%20%28filem%201996%29"&gt;The Treasure Seekers&lt;/a&gt; (1996). Jones meranke &lt;a href="Ethel%20Hallow"&gt;Ethel Hallow&lt;/a&gt; kanggo siji musim ing acara televisi &lt;a href="The%20Worst%20Witch%20%28seri%20TV%201998%29"&gt;The Worst Witch&lt;/a&gt; lan sekuele, &lt;a href="Weirdsister%20College"&gt;Weirdsister College&lt;/a&gt;. Ia absen sakwetoro saka donya perfileman kanggo ngelanjutke pendidikan nganti lulus saka &lt;a href="Wadham%20College%2C%20Oxford"&gt;Wadham College, Oxford&lt;/a&gt; ing taun 2006. Ing radio, ia meranke Emma Grundy ing &lt;a href="The%20Archers"&gt;The Archers&lt;/a&gt; sing disiarke &lt;a href="BBC"&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;. Ing 2008, ia melu ing &lt;a href="The%20Chalk%20Garden"&gt;The Chalk Garden&lt;/a&gt; sing diprodhuksi dening &lt;a href="Donmar%20Warehouse"&gt;Donmar Warehouse&lt;/a&gt;.
Sawise 2006, Jones tampil ing berbagai filem kayata &lt;a href="Northanger%20Abbey%20%28filem%202007%29"&gt;Northanger Abbey&lt;/a&gt; (2007), &lt;a href="Brideshead%20Revisited%20%28filem%29"&gt;Brideshead Revisited&lt;/a&gt; (2008), &lt;a href="Ch%C3%A9ri%20%28filem%29"&gt;Chéri&lt;/a&gt; (2009), lan &lt;a href="The%20Tempest%20%28filem%202010%29"&gt;The Tempest&lt;/a&gt; (2010).
