<doc id="184470" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=184470" title="Tōhoku Shinkansen">
Tōhoku Shinkansen

Tōhoku Shinkansen (東北新幹線, Tōhoku Shinkansen secara harfiah "Shinkansen timur laut") yaiku jalur sepur &lt;a href="Shinkansen"&gt;Shinkansen&lt;/a&gt; kacepetan dhuwur Jepang, sing nyambungake &lt;a href="Tokyo"&gt;Tokyo&lt;/a&gt; karo &lt;a href="Aomori%2C%20Aomori"&gt;Aomori&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Prefektur%20Aomori"&gt;Prefektur Aomori&lt;/a&gt; kanthi dawane rute 674.9 km, ndadekake jalur Shinkansen paling dawa ing Jepang. Iki lumaku ngliwati &lt;a href="wilayah%20T%C5%8Dhoku"&gt;wilayah Tōhoku&lt;/a&gt; sing luwih jarang pedunung ing pulo utama Jepang, &lt;a href="Honshu"&gt;Honshu&lt;/a&gt;, lan diterusake dening &lt;a href="Hokkaido%20Shinkansen"&gt;Hokkaido Shinkansen&lt;/a&gt; liwat &lt;a href="Seikan%20Tunnel"&gt;Seikan Tunnel&lt;/a&gt; menyang &lt;a href="Setatsiyun%20Shin-Hakodate-Hokuto"&gt;Shin-Hakodate-Hokuto&lt;/a&gt; (bagean iki dibukak Maret 2016) lan samesthine bakal diterusake menyang Sapporo ing taun 2030.
Iki duwe rong jalur cabang &lt;a href="Mini-shinkansen"&gt;Mini-shinkansen&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Yamagata%20Shinkansen"&gt;Yamagata Shinkansen&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Akita%20Shinkansen"&gt;Akita Shinkansen&lt;/a&gt;. Jalur kasebut dilakokno dening &lt;a href="East%20Japan%20Railway%20Company"&gt;East Japan Railway Company&lt;/a&gt; (JR East).
<h2>Layanan</h2>
Layanan.
Ana papat layanan sing beroperasi:
<ul>
<li>&lt;a href="Hayabusa%20%28sepur%29"&gt;Hayabusa&lt;/a&gt;, Tokyo – Shin-Aomori/Shin-Hakodate-Hokuto mandheg winates, wiwit 5 Maret 2011</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Hayate%20%28sepur%29"&gt;Hayate&lt;/a&gt;, Morioka/Shin-Aomori – Shin-Hakodate-Hokuto mandheg winates, wiwit 26 Maret 2016, (jeneng iki wis digunakake wiwit 1 Desember 2002)</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Yamabiko"&gt;Yamabiko&lt;/a&gt;, Tokyo – Sendai mandheg winates, lan kabeh stasiun menyang Morioka, wiwit Juni 1982</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Nasuno"&gt;Nasuno&lt;/a&gt;, Tokyo – Oyama/Nasushiobara/Kōriyama kabeh stasiun, wiwit 1995</li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li>&lt;a href="Aoba%20%28sepur%29"&gt;Aoba&lt;/a&gt;, Tokyo – Sendai kabeh stasiun, Juni 1982 – Oktober 1997 (digabungake karo Nasuno)</li>
</ul>
Liwat sepur ing jalur &lt;a href="Akita%20Shinkansen"&gt;Akita Shinkansen&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Yamagata%20Shinkansen"&gt;Yamagata Shinkansen&lt;/a&gt; uga lumaku ing jalur Tōhoku Shinkansen saben saka &lt;a href="Morioka"&gt;Morioka&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Fukushima%2C%20Fukushima"&gt;Fukushima&lt;/a&gt;.
Ing Maret 2021, kacepetan jalur maksimal yaiku 110 km/h antarane Tokyo lan Ueno, 130 km/h antarane Ueno lan Ōmiya, 275 km/h antarane Ōmiya lan Utsunomiya, 320 km/h antarane Utsunomiya lan Morioka, lan 260 km/h antarane Morioka and Shin-Aomori.
