<doc id="184509" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=184509" title="Selahattin Ülkümen">
Selahattin Ülkümen

Selahattin Ülkümen (#ALIH) yaiku &lt;a href="diplomat"&gt;diplomat&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="konsul"&gt;konsul&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="wong%20Turki"&gt;Turki&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Rhodes"&gt;Rhodes&lt;/a&gt; ing wektu &lt;a href="Perang%20Donya%20II"&gt;Perang Donya II&lt;/a&gt;. Ia nyelametke akeh wong &lt;a href="Yahudi"&gt;Yahudi&lt;/a&gt; setempat saka &lt;a href="Holokaus"&gt;Holokaus&lt;/a&gt;. Ing taun 1989, Israel ngakuine minangka salah sijining &lt;a href="Wong%20Apik%20saka%20Berbagai%20Bangsa"&gt;Wong Apik saka Berbagai Bangsa&lt;/a&gt; lan nyantumke jenenge ing di &lt;a href="Yad%20Vashem"&gt;Yad Vashem&lt;/a&gt;.
Penduduk Yahudi Turki lan &lt;a href="wong%20Grikenlan"&gt;Grikenlan&lt;/a&gt; dideportasi menyang &lt;a href="kamp%20kematian"&gt;kamp kematian&lt;/a&gt; ing pulo &lt;a href="Corfu"&gt;Corfu&lt;/a&gt;. Ing pulo Rhodes, Ülkümen nyelametke nyaris 50 wong saka total 2.000 penduduk Yahudi sawise &lt;a href="Jerman"&gt;Jerman&lt;/a&gt; ngerebut pulo kasebut. Jerman datheng sawise &lt;a href="Benito%20Mussolini"&gt;Benito Mussolini&lt;/a&gt; tumbang saka papréntahan &lt;a href="Itali"&gt;Itali&lt;/a&gt; lan nyepakati &lt;a href="gencatan%20senjata"&gt;gencatan senjata&lt;/a&gt; karo &lt;a href="Sekutu%20ing%20Perang%20Donya%20II"&gt;Sekutu&lt;/a&gt;.
