Abdul Ahad Mohmand

Abdul Ahad Mohmand (; #ALIH) yaiku mantan &lt;a href="penerbang"&gt;penerbang&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Angkatan%20Udhara%20Afghanistan"&gt;Angkatan Udhara Afghanistan&lt;/a&gt; sing dadi wong Afghanistan kapisan lan &lt;a href="Muslim"&gt;Muslim&lt;/a&gt; kapapat sing datheng menyang ruang angkasa. Ia dadi salah sijining anggota kru &lt;a href="Soyuz%20TM-6"&gt;Soyuz TM-6&lt;/a&gt; lan ngedalani sanga dina ing &lt;a href="setatsiyun%20ruang%20angkasa"&gt;setatsiyun ruang angkasa&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Mir"&gt;Mir&lt;/a&gt; ing 1988 minangka Kosmonaut Riset &lt;a href="Intercosmos"&gt;Intercosmos&lt;/a&gt;. Ia dadi &lt;a href="pratelan%20antariksawan%20Muslim"&gt;Muslim kapapat sing datheng menyang ruang angkasa&lt;/a&gt;, sawise &lt;a href="Sultan%20bin%20Salman%20Al%20Saud"&gt;Sultan bin Salman Al Saud&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Muhammed%20Faris"&gt;Muhammed Faris&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Musa%20Manarov"&gt;Musa Manarov&lt;/a&gt;. Ing misi kasebut, Abdul Ahad Mohmand dadi kosmonaut kapisan sing nganggo basa &lt;a href="Pashto"&gt;Pashto&lt;/a&gt; sawise ia nggawe panggilan telepon menyang &lt;a href="Republik%20Demokrat%20Afghanistan"&gt;Afghanistan&lt;/a&gt;.
