<doc id="185001" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=185001" title="Sénégal ing Olimpiade">
Sénégal ing Olimpiade

&lt;a href="S%C3%A9n%C3%A9gal"&gt;Sénégal&lt;/a&gt; sampun ngirimi para atlet menyang kabeh &lt;a href="Olimpiade%20Musim%20Panas"&gt;Olimpiade Musim Panas&lt;/a&gt; sing dianakake sawise 1964. Ora kayata sabagean gedhe nagara tanggane, Sénégal ora tau absen saka Olimpiade Musim Panas sawise kamardikane. Ming kaping siji nagara kasebut menangke medhali Olimpiade: &lt;a href="Amadou%20Dia%20Ba"&gt;Amadou Dia Ba&lt;/a&gt;, sing menangke medhali perak ing bidang lumayu gawang 400 meter lanang ing &lt;a href="Olimpiade%20Musim%20Panas%201988"&gt;1988&lt;/a&gt;. Nanging, &lt;a href="Abdoulaye%20Seye"&gt;Abdoulaye Seye&lt;/a&gt;, sing ngwakili Prancis, menangke medhali prunggu ing bidang 200 meter ing &lt;a href="Olimpiade%20Musim%20Panas%201960"&gt;1960&lt;/a&gt;, loro wulan sawise &lt;a href="Pedherasi%20Mali"&gt;Pedherasi Mali&lt;/a&gt; sing berumur endhep entuk kamardikan lan sajumlah dina sawise Sénégal metu saka fédherasi iku.
Sénégal menika salah sijining saka sajumlah cilik nagara &lt;a href="tropis"&gt;tropis&lt;/a&gt; sing melu ing &lt;a href="Olimpiade%20Musim%20Dingin"&gt;Olimpiade Musim Dingin&lt;/a&gt;. Para atlet musim dingin-ne melu ing lima Olimpiade Musim Dingin sawise &lt;a href="Olimpiade%20Musim%20Dingin%201984"&gt;1984&lt;/a&gt;, nanging nagara kasebut ora tau menangke medhali. Sénégal diwakili ing taun 1984, 1992 lan 1994 dening &lt;a href="Lamine%20Gu%C3%A8ye%20%28atlet%20ski%29"&gt;Lamine Guèye&lt;/a&gt;, lan ing 2006 lan 2010 dening &lt;a href="Leyti%20Seck"&gt;Leyti Seck&lt;/a&gt;.
