<doc id="185056" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=185056" title="San'yō Shinkansen">
San'yō Shinkansen

San'yō Shinkansen (山陽新幹線, San'yō Shinkansen) ya iku jalur sepur kacepetan dhuwur &lt;a href="Shinkansen"&gt;Shinkansen&lt;/a&gt; Jepang, nyambungake &lt;a href="Stasiun%20Shin-%C5%8Csaka"&gt;Shin-Osaka&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Osaka"&gt;Osaka&lt;/a&gt; karo &lt;a href="Stasiun%20Hakata"&gt;Stasiun Hakata&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Fukuoka"&gt;Fukuoka&lt;/a&gt;, loro kutha gedhé ing Jepang kulon. Dioperasikake dening &lt;a href="West%20Japan%20Railway%20Company"&gt;West Japan Railway Company&lt;/a&gt; (JR West), iki minangka tutugan arah kulon saka &lt;a href="T%C5%8Dkaid%C5%8D%20Shinkansen"&gt;Tōkaidō Shinkansen&lt;/a&gt; lan uga nglayani kutha-kutha utama liyane ing antarane ing &lt;a href="Honshu"&gt;Honshu&lt;/a&gt; lan pulo &lt;a href="Kyushu"&gt;Kyushu&lt;/a&gt;, kayata &lt;a href="Kobe"&gt;Kobe&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Himeji%2C%20Hy%C5%8Dgo"&gt;Himeji&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Okayama"&gt;Okayama&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Hiroshima"&gt;Hiroshima&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Kitakyushu"&gt;Kitakyushu&lt;/a&gt;. San'yō Shinkansen nyambungake Hakata karo Osaka sajrone rong jam setengah, kanthi sepur beroperasi ing kacepetan operasi maksimum 300 km/h.
Sawetara sepur &lt;a href="Nozomi%20%28sepur%29"&gt;Nozomi&lt;/a&gt; beroperasi terus-terusan ing jalur San'yō lan Tōkaidō Shinkansen, nyambungake Tokyo lan Hakata sajrone limang jam.
<h2>Stations</h2>
Stations.
Kabeh stasiun ing San'yō Shinkansen diduweni lan dioperasikake dening JR West, kajaba Shin-Osaka sing dikelola dening &lt;a href="Central%20Japan%20Railway%20Company"&gt;Central Japan Railway Company&lt;/a&gt; (JR Central). Sepur "Kodama" mandheg ing kabeh stasiun; layanan liyane duwe pola mandheg sing beda-beda. Kabeh sepur mandheg ing Shin-Osaka, Shin-Kobe, Okayama, Hiroshima, Kokura, lan Hakata. &lt;a href="Japan%20Rail%20Pass"&gt;Japan Rail Pass&lt;/a&gt; ora sah kanggo lelungan nganggo sepur Nozomi utawa Mizuho.
